(9, 16, 2, 'Queen Marika the Eternal', '{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"Early Life\"},{\"attributes\":{\"header\":2},\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Marika was a \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Numen\"},\"insert\":\"Numen\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\", as well as a Shaman from the Shaman Village in the Hinterlands.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-GoldenBraid-2\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[2]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" The \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Hornsent_(people)\"},\"insert\":\"Hornsent\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" considered the flesh of Shamans to meld harmoniously with others,\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-3\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[3]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"and utilised this property in the jar rituals conducted on persecuted criminals, who were sliced up and stuffed into the jars to be reborn as saints instead.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-4\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[4]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-5\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[5]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" The people of Marika\'s village were stolen away from their home to be used for this purpose.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-6\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[6]\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Marika was at some point recognised as an \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Empyrean\"},\"insert\":\"Empyrean\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" by the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Two_Fingers\"},\"insert\":\"Two Fingers\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" and gifted a \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Shadowbound_Beast\"},\"insert\":\"Shadowbound Beast\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\": her half-brother \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Maliketh\"},\"insert\":\"Maliketh\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\". She later ascended to godhood at the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Gate_of_Divinity\"},\"insert\":\"Gate of Divinity\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" atop the tower of \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Enir-Ilim\"},\"insert\":\"Enir-Ilim\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\",\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-7\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[7]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" becoming the vessel for the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Elden_Ring_(concept)\"},\"insert\":\"Elden Ring\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\".\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-8\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[8]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" This affair led to the birth of the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Erdtree\"},\"insert\":\"Erdtree\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" and \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Scadutree\"},\"insert\":\"Scadutree\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\",\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-9\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[9]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-10\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[10]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" and was considered a betrayal by the Hornsent.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Prior to or following her ascension, Marika came into conflict with another Empyrean known as the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Gloam-Eyed_Queen\"},\"insert\":\"Gloam-Eyed Queen\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\". After emerging victorious, and desiring a world free of \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Rune_of_Death\"},\"insert\":\"Destined Death\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\", she removed the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Rune_of_Death\"},\"insert\":\"Rune of Death\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" from the Elden Ring,\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-11\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[11]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" using Maliketh as a vessel to lock it away,\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-12\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[12]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" thus establishing the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Golden_Order\"},\"insert\":\"Golden Order\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\".\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-13\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[13]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-14\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[14]\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"At some point during this period, Marika took the warrior \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Godfrey,_First_Elden_Lord\"},\"insert\":\"Godfrey\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" as her consort, who became both the first demigod and first Elden Lord.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-15\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[15]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-16\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[16]\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Eventually, Marika returned to the abandoned Shaman Village for the last time. After cutting off a braid of her hair and leaving it as an offering to the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Grandmother\"},\"insert\":\"Grandmother\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\", she bathed her home in the healing light of gold, knowing full well that there was no one to heal, and would never return.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-GoldenBraid-2\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[2]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-17\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[17]\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Age of the Erdtree\"},{\"attributes\":{\"header\":2},\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"In the early days, everything was in opposition to the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Erdtree\"},\"insert\":\"Erdtree\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\".\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-18\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[18]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" With Godfrey’s aid,\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-19\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[19]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" Marika waged a \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/War_Against_the_Giants\"},\"insert\":\"War Against the Giants\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" atop the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Mountaintops_of_the_Giants\"},\"insert\":\"frigid northern mountains\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\", whose \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Flame_of_Ruin\"},\"insert\":\"Flame of Ruin\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" was capable of burning the Erdtree.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-20\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[20]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Ultimately victorious, Marika was believed to have slain the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Fell_God\"},\"insert\":\"Fell God\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" of the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Fire_Giants\"},\"insert\":\"Fire Giants\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\".\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-21\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[21]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" Upon learning that the Flame of Ruin would never die, however, she cursed the last of the giants to tend to it for eternity.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-22\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[22]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" Marika declared the path the mountains as \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Forbidden_Lands\"},\"insert\":\"Forbidden Lands\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" and excised details of the war from history.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-23\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[23]\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Marika and Godfrey would rule together and have at least three children: \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Godwyn_the_Golden\"},\"insert\":\"Godwyn the Golden\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" and the twins \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Morgott,_the_Omen_King\"},\"insert\":\"Morgott\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"and \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Mohg,_Lord_of_Blood\"},\"insert\":\"Mohg\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\". The twins were both born as accursed \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Omen\"},\"insert\":\"Omen\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" and were hidden in the depths below the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Leyndell,_Royal_Capital\"},\"insert\":\"capital\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\". Even so, Godfrey and his \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Golden_Lineage\"},\"insert\":\"Golden Lineage\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" would be counted as the first of the demigods.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-24\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[24]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" Godfrey went on to conquer many lands for the Erdtree.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Liurnian Wars\"},{\"attributes\":{\"header\":2},\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\",\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Queen Marika desired to conquer \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Liurnia_of_the_Lakes\"},\"insert\":\"Liurnia of the Lakes\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\", the land of the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Academy_of_Raya_Lucaria\"},\"insert\":\"Academy of Raya Lucaria\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\" and the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Carian_Royal_Family\"},\"insert\":\"Carian Royal Family\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\". She declared war on the glintstone sorcerers and sent a golden host led by her secret other half: a red-haired champion named \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Radagon\"},\"insert\":\"Radagon\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\". The champions of the moon, led by \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Rennala\"},\"insert\":\"Rennala\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\", repelled the glorious warriors of the Erdtree for a time but it ended in a draw. In the second Liurnian War, Radagon invades again but this time, he uses the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Celestial_Dew\"},\"insert\":\"Celestial Dew\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\" at the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Church_of_Vows\"},\"insert\":\"Church of Vows\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\" in a ritual to recant his aggressions and seek absolution. The Carian Queen accepted and their wrongdoings were washed away. The two were wed and produced three children: \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Radahn\"},\"insert\":\"Radahn\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\", \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Rykard\"},\"insert\":\"Rykard\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\", and \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Ranni\"},\"insert\":\"Ranni\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\",\"background\":\"rgba(5, 14, 8, 0.9)\"},\"insert\":\".\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Godfrey\'s banishment\"},{\"attributes\":{\"header\":2},\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"With her rule secure, Marika announced her intention to search the depths of the Golden Order, declaring the early days of blind belief a thing long past.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-25\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[25]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" When Godfrey\'s last foe fell it was said the hue of his eyes had faded.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-26\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[26]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Marika banished him and his kinfolk from the Lands Between, robbing them of their \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Grace\"},\"insert\":\"grace\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\",\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-27\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[27]\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" thus creating the first \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Tarnished\"},\"insert\":\"Tarnished\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\", all in the hope that they would grow stronger by waging war in lands outside her rule, dying, and then eventually being revived with their guidance of grace returned.\"},{\"attributes\":{\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Queen_Marika_the_Eternal#cite_note-28\",\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"script\":\"super\"},\"insert\":\"[28]\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\"Marika sent her son \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Messmer_the_Impaler\"},\"insert\":\"Messmer\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" away on a \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Crusade\"},\"insert\":\"crusade\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" into the lands of the Hornsent. Despite her precautions, her fear of the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Abyssal_Serpent\"},\"insert\":\"Abyssal Serpent\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\" sealed within him led her to trap him within the \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Realm_of_Shadow\"},\"insert\":\"Realm of Shadow\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\", where he would wage war to exterminate the Hornsent and devastate their lands. No matter how many of her enemies burned in his \"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"var(--theme-link-color)\",\"link\":\"https://eldenring.fandom.com/wiki/Messmerfire\"},\"insert\":\"flame\"},{\"attributes\":{\"color\":\"#e6e6e6\"},\"insert\":\", however, Messmer received no sign from Marika to end his crusade. To hide away these actions and the true nature of her godhood, Marika hid the Realm of Shadow behind a magical veil to obscure it from public knowledge.\"},{\"insert\":\"\\n\"},{\"attributes\":{\"header\":2},\"insert\":\"\\n\"}]}', , '2024-11-19 15:00:00');
